    mcq1: ["What does Philippians 2:13 say about God?", ["It is God who works in you, both to will and to work for his good pleasure", "God does nothing for us", "God asks us to earn salvation", "God works only through leaders"], 0, "God works in us to will and to work."],
    mcq2: ["What does Colossians 2:23 say about self-made religion?", ["It is of no value in stopping the indulgence of the flesh", "It is the best way to holiness", "It earns salvation", "It replaces grace"], 0, "Such rules cannot restrain the flesh."],
