    mcq1: ["What did Joel say God wanted in Joel 2:12-13?", ["Return to me with all your heart, with fasting, weeping and mourning; rend your hearts", "Only outward fasting", "Longer sacrifices", "Silence"], 0, "God wanted a return with all the heart."],
    mcq2: ["Why did Ezra proclaim a fast at the river Ahava?", ["To humble themselves and seek a safe journey from God", "To punish the people", "To celebrate", "To avoid work"], 0, "They sought a straight way from God."],
