    apply: "Read Matthew 4:1-11 and note how Jesus used Scripture. Choose a verse to carry with you this week, such as Matthew 4:4, and think about what it means to live by God's word. If you are able, consider a gentle fast of one meal, using the time to read and pray, as Jesus did.",
    activity: "Make a chart of everything Jesus said or did about fasting in Matthew 4, 6 and 9. Ask learners what each shows about the purpose and spirit of fasting. Close by reading Matthew 9:14-15 and discussing what it means to long for the bridegroom.",
