    mcq2: ["What did Jesus say about fasting in Matthew 9:15?", ["The days will come when the bridegroom is taken away, and then they will fast", "His disciples must always fast", "Fasting is forbidden", "Fasting replaces prayer"], 0, "He said they would fast after he was taken away."],
